	ckets\nResale Tickets \nBill Burr Live LIVE at Reno Events Center\nEmmy an
	d Grammy Award nominee Bill Burr brings his signature\, no-holds-barred st
	and-up comedy to Reno for one unforgettable night. Known for his fearless 
	takes on modern life\, relationships\, and society\, Burr delivers a raw a
	nd hilarious performance that has made him one of the most celebrated come
	dians of his generation. Don’t miss this rare Reno appearance! \nEvent Det
	ails\nDate: Friday\, July 31\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM (Doors open 7:00 PM)\nV
