	ommentary\, Burr has released multiple acclaimed Netflix specials and star
	s in the hit series “F Is for Family.” His Monday Morning Podcast is one o
	f the most downloaded comedy podcasts in the world. \nWhat to Expect\n\nFe
	arless\, no-holds-barred stand-up comedy from one of the best in the busin
	ess\nSharp observations on modern life\, relationships\, and pop culture\n
	A phone-free experience — be fully present for every punchline\nHigh-energ
	y performance in an intimate arena setting\nOne of the most anticipated co
	medy shows of 2026 in Reno\nLimited tickets remaining — less than 1% left!
	\n\nVenue Information\nThe Reno Events Center is a premier entertainment v
	enue located in the heart of downtown Reno at 400 University Way. The faci
	lity offers excellent sightlines\, accessible seating\, and is convenientl
	y located near major casinos and hotels. The venue enforces a clear bag po
	licy — visit the RSCVA website for details. \nTicket Information\nTickets 
	are priced from $146 – $174 with very limited availability remaining. This
	 is a phone-free event — Yondr pouches will be provided at the door. Pleas
