	go comedy circuit\, McCombs has built a loyal following with his relatable
	 takes on everyday life. His performances are consistently praised for the
	ir clever writing and natural delivery. \nWhat to Expect\n\nSharp\, observ
	ational stand-up comedy\nIntimate comedy club setting at CG’s Comedy Club\
	nFull bar service available\nShow starts at 8:00 PM sharp\n21+ event — val
	id photo ID required\nGreat night out in the Bolingbrook/Chicago suburbs\n
	\nVenue Information\nCG’s Comedy Club is located at 619 E. Boughton Rd. in
	 Bolingbrook\, IL\, a popular comedy destination in the Chicago suburbs. T
	he club features a full bar and an intimate showroom atmosphere perfect fo
	r live stand-up comedy. \nTicket Information\nTickets are available throug
	h Ticketmaster and VividSeats. All shows are 21 and up. Contact the venue 
	at (630) 410-8906 for more information. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets
